# Private denylist for scripts/check_leak.py
#
# Copy this file to `.leakcheck-local.txt` and add concrete terms that must
# never appear in a public commit: employer-specific system names, project
# codenames, internal service identifiers, real names, employee ids, and so on.
#
# `.leakcheck-local.txt` is gitignored and must stay that way. A committed list
# of the words you are trying to hide discloses exactly what you meant to hide.
#
# One term per line. Matching is case-insensitive and literal (not a regex).
# Lines starting with `#` are comments.
#
# Example entries -- replace with your own:
#
# MyEmployerInternalSystemName
# project-codename
# some-internal-service-id
